Nexus Bot began from an early open-source Discord bot template, but has since
been rewritten and extended so extensively (custom AI engine, security/anti-
raid system, prediction and economy features, dashboard, and more) that it is
now Patrick Houle's own project. This license applies to the project as it
exists today.

